      "content": "wait, vitamin C?? i haven't heard anything about that before. i thought vitamin K was the only thing that mattered for warfarin. are you sure 500mg of vitamin C is the right way to do this? and a pound of beef every single day sounds like a lot, but if it helps stabilize my levels so i can stay out of the clinic, i guess i can try it. is there any other supplement i should be taking alongside the vitamin C to make sure it actually works and doesn't cause any weird side effects?",
